flowchart TD
    RR[Recurrence Relations] --> DEF[Definitions]
    RR --> SOL[Solution Methods]
    RR --> HOM[Linear Homogeneous]
    RR --> NON[Nonhomogeneous]
    RR --> GF[Generating Functions]
    RR --> ALG[Algorithm Analysis]

    DEF --> D1[Recurrence relation]
    DEF --> D2[Initial conditions]
    DEF --> D3[Solution sequence]
    DEF --> D4[Example: Fibonacci]

    SOL --> S1[Iteration forward substitution]
    SOL --> S2[Backward substitution]
    SOL --> S3[Prove pattern by induction]

    HOM --> H1["Form: an = c1 an-1 + ... + ck an-k"]
    HOM --> H2[Characteristic equation]
    HOM --> H3[Distinct roots case]
    HOM --> H4[Repeated roots case]

    NON --> N1["Form: add fn term"]
    N1 --> N2[Homogeneous part anh]
    N1 --> N3[Particular part anp]
    N3 --> N4[Polynomial fn]
    N3 --> N5[Exponential fn]

    GF --> G1["Gx = sum an x^n"]
    G1 --> G2[Transform recurrence]
    G1 --> G3[Solve for Gx]
    G1 --> G4[Extract coefficients]

    ALG --> A1["Linear search: Tn = Tn-1 + 1"]
    ALG --> A2["Binary search: Tn = Tn/2 + 1"]
    ALG --> A3["Merge sort: Tn = 2Tn/2 + n"]
